# Docker Rules


## Requirement

Everything must run using Docker.


Services:


frontend

backend

postgres

redis

sidekiq


==================================================
DOCKERFILE
==================================================

Use:

- Multi-stage builds
- Minimal images
- Production optimization


==================================================
DEVELOPMENT
==================================================

Docker Compose must support:


- Hot reload
- Local development
- Database persistence
- Redis persistence


==================================================
PRODUCTION
==================================================

Production containers must support:


- Health checks
- Logging
- Environment variables
- Security hardening


==================================================
NETWORKING
==================================================

Containers communicate using Docker networks.


Never expose internal services publicly.


==================================================
DATABASE
==================================================

Database migrations must be automated.


Deployment must handle:


- migrations
- rollback strategy